# smoke.trace - small hand-written trace for checking tb_trace.v
# Default config: 1 KB cache, 16 B blocks -> index = addr[9:4], tag = addr[31:10]
#
# 1) cold miss, then the other 3 words of the same block hit (spatial locality)
R 00000040
R 00000044
R 00000048
R 0000004C
# 2) same block again: all hits (temporal locality)
R 00000040
R 0000004C
# 3) 0x440 is exactly 1 KB above 0x040 -> same index 4, different tag -> conflict
R 00000440
R 00000040
R 00000440
# 4) write hit: cache and memory both updated (write-through)
W 00000444 12345678
R 00000444
# 5) write miss: memory updated, block NOT brought into the cache,
#    so the next read misses (and refills), and the one after that hits
W 00000800 0BADF00D
R 00000800
R 00000800
